01:04:04,821 --> 01:04:06,150
(Bye. I love you.)

1772
01:04:06,151 --> 01:04:08,451
My gosh. That's so sweet.

1773
01:04:10,021 --> 01:04:11,790
(He crosses the Han River...)

1774
01:04:11,791 --> 01:04:12,920
