1845
01:07:02,791 --> 01:07:04,190
- Gosh. - What an angel.

1846
01:07:04,191 --> 01:07:06,131
- I got so surprised. - He's really an angel.

1847
01:07:06,331 --> 01:07:09,331
I really choked up after seeing that.

1848
01:07:10,301 --> 01:07:11,700
I'm his junior by many years,

1849
01:07:11,701 --> 01:07:14,910
