1871
01:07:56,951 --> 01:07:59,420
- I can use them while commenting. - That's right.

1872
01:07:59,421 --> 01:08:00,750
That's a great tip.

1873
01:08:00,751 --> 01:08:03,191
That could build him a character.

1874
01:08:03,451 --> 01:08:06,120
You could explain the atmosphere...

1875
01:08:06,121 --> 01:08:08,090
before the game starts.

1876
01:08:08,091 --> 01:08:09,161
What did you see?

1877
01:08:11,261 --> 01:08:14,031
I was at a red light at the intersection,

1878
01:08:14,731 --> 01:08:16,831
the KT Wiz fans and the Samsung Lions fans...

1879
01:08:17,071 --> 01:08:20,300
kept crossing the road when it was two hours before the game.

1880
01:08:20,301 --> 01:08:21,970
- That's good. At the crosswalk? - So...

1881
01:08:21,971 --> 01:08:23,340
- Yes, at the crosswalk. - That's right.

1882
01:08:23,341 --> 01:08:25,610
Seeing the endless line of fans,

1883
01:08:25,611 --> 01:08:27,281
I thought their fight for the rankings would be endless too.

1884
01:08:27,581 --> 01:08:28,680
(Impressed)

1885
01:08:28,681 --> 01:08:29,911
That's a good one.

1886
01:08:30,881 --> 01:08:32,721
- That's good. - That was really nice.

1887
01:08:32,821 --> 01:08:34,491
- Seriously. - You're good.

1888
01:08:35,291 --> 01:08:37,821
