1889
01:08:38,721 --> 01:08:39,890
Since it's a fight...

1890
01:08:39,891 --> 01:08:41,730
- between 3rd and 5th places. - Good. You're a sportscaster.

1891
01:08:41,731 --> 01:08:43,161
Since it's a fight between 3rd and 5th places.

1892
01:08:44,161 --> 01:08:45,501
I wanted to use wordplay a little.

1893
01:08:47,901 --> 01:08:48,901
That was cool.

1894
01:08:48,902 --> 01:08:50,401
Everything is a source.

1895
01:08:50,931 --> 01:08:52,071
- Let's go up. - Okay.

1896
01:08:52,901 --> 01:08:55,911
- That's why you told me to take it. - These days...

1897
01:08:56,611 --> 01:08:57,840
(Following the veteran)

1898
01:08:57,841 --> 01:09:00,181
- Isn't that area for spectators? - The stadium that's open...

1899
01:09:00,511 --> 01:09:01,710
It's open and spacious.

1900
