You could wait here too.

1905
01:09:12,191 --> 01:09:14,020
This is the commentary booth.

1906
01:09:14,021 --> 01:09:16,130
- There's no AC in here. - We use...

1907
01:09:16,131 --> 01:09:17,291
- a fan here. - A fan? I see.

1908
01:09:18,001 --> 01:09:19,301
- It must be really hot in summer. - Is it because of the noise?

1909
01:09:19,431 --> 01:09:20,700
- Right. It's because of the noise. - To prevent any noise...

1910
01:09:20,701 --> 01:09:21,971
while commenting.

1911
01:09:23,501 --> 01:09:24,670
(Jaw-dropping)

1912
01:09:24,671 --> 01:09:25,671
(Impressed)

1913
01:09:26,571 --> 01:09:27,970
It's really close.

1914
01:09:27,971 --> 01:09:29,271
(The commentary booth's view is unobstructed.)

1915
01:09:30,011 --> 01:09:32,640
