1919
01:09:40,281 --> 01:09:42,051
It's right at the center.

1920
01:09:42,321 --> 01:09:43,490
How fascinating.

1921
01:09:43,491 --> 01:09:44,591
The seat with the best view.

1922
01:09:45,061 --> 01:09:46,220
- And also... - Yes.

1923
01:09:46,221 --> 01:09:47,661
- That's amazing. - If you sit here...

1924
01:09:48,431 --> 01:09:49,431
(No matter how many times he looks, the view seems surreal.)

1925
01:09:49,432 --> 01:09:51,130
How did you feel when you entered the booth?

1926
01:09:51,131 --> 01:09:52,400
I was really excited.

1927
01:09:52,401 --> 01:09:54,060
I could see everything,

1928
01:09:54,061 --> 01:09:56,901
