1932
01:10:04,681 --> 01:10:05,711
You're right.

1933
01:10:06,311 --> 01:10:07,380
Right.

1934
01:10:07,381 --> 01:10:08,681
- If you sit... - The view is amazing.

1935
01:10:09,751 --> 01:10:12,221
- It's like a view in a game. - Right. I'd love to go there.

1936
01:10:12,581 --> 01:10:15,491
Using this... Wait.

1937
01:10:16,091 --> 01:10:17,320
You can use it to rewatch.

1938
01:10:17,321 --> 01:10:18,660
- We are... - What is it?

1939
01:10:18,661 --> 01:10:19,720
Is someone here?

1940
01:10:19,721 --> 01:10:21,490
If you're in sports broadcasting,

1941
01:10:21,491 --> 01:10:24,190
