1948
01:10:41,181 --> 01:10:42,310
- It's Director Kim Soo Hwan. - Goodness.

1949
01:10:42,311 --> 01:10:43,551
- Hello, I'm Ko Kang Yong. - Nice to meet you.

1950
01:10:44,111 --> 01:10:45,651
(Glancing)

1951
01:10:45,781 --> 01:10:47,320
Kang Yong admires you a lot.

1952
01:10:47,321 --> 01:10:49,321
- I really do. - Come on.

1953
