1954
01:10:51,361 --> 01:10:52,590
- Really? - Yes.

1955
01:10:52,591 --> 01:10:53,990
- Nice to meet you. - I'm a really big fan.

1956
01:10:53,991 --> 01:10:55,061
You've got to believe it.

1957
01:10:55,791 --> 01:10:56,930
(Smiling right away upon seeing his favorite sportscaster)

1958
01:10:56,931 --> 01:10:58,100
He must've been a big fan.

1959
01:10:58,101 --> 01:10:59,301
- Right. - I was really happy.

1960
01:10:59,731 --> 01:11:00,900
It was really fascinating.

1961
01:11:00,901 --> 01:11:02,671
It was really fascinating to see him up close.

1962
01:11:03,201 --> 01:11:04,740
I'd only heard his voice,

1963
01:11:04,741 --> 01:11:07,670
