1964
01:11:07,671 --> 01:11:10,110
- You can't forget that. - You can't.

1965
01:11:10,111 --> 01:11:11,281
You can't.

1966
01:11:12,211 --> 01:11:13,440
The moment of seeing his star.

1967
01:11:13,441 --> 01:11:15,410
You do dubbing too.

1968
01:11:15,411 --> 01:11:18,520
- I do. - I've been watching it carefully.

1969
01:11:18,521 --> 01:11:19,651
