1970
01:11:19,981 --> 01:11:21,151
Please give an evaluation.

1971
01:11:21,421 --> 01:11:24,291
- I need to know, so... - I was worried at first.

1972
01:11:25,221 --> 01:11:26,520
(Nervous)

1973
01:11:26,521 --> 01:11:28,561
(Gulping)

1974
01:11:29,161 --> 01:11:30,930
- But I could see him grow. - "Grow."

1975
01:11:30,931 --> 01:11:32,300
- Really? - My juniors...

1976
01:11:32,301 --> 01:11:34,031
- are keeping you in check. - Really?

1977
01:11:34,531 --> 01:11:36,401
- Really? - That's for sure.

1978
01:11:36,971 --> 01:11:38,570
I thought they didn't know my existence.

1979
01:11:38,571 --> 01:11:41,040
- Of course we do. - They always watch you.

1980
01:11:41,041 --> 01:11:43,411
- Really? I'm really honored. - He does, at least.

1981
01:11:43,671 --> 01:11:45,080
- Say hello. - Hey.

1982
01:11:45,081 --> 01:11:46,240
- Hello. - What a coincidence.

1983
01:11:46,241 --> 01:11:47,510
- I'm Ko Kang Yong. - Nice to meet you.

1984
01:11:47,511 --> 01:11:48,581
Who is that?

1985
01:11:48,992 --> 01:11:50,231
- Say hello. - Hey.

1986
01:11:50,232 --> 01:11:51,362
- Hello. - What a coincidence.

1987
01:11:51,562 --> 01:11:52,801
- I'm Ko Kang Yong. - Nice to meet you.

1988
01:11:52,802 --> 01:11:53,902
Who is that?

1989
01:11:54,672 --> 01:11:55,901
This is a fan.

1990
01:11:55,902 --> 01:11:57,572
- Isn't that Jeon In Kwon? - Jeon In Kwon...

1991
01:11:58,572 --> 01:12:00,671
