2002
01:12:21,592 --> 01:12:23,391
It must've been a really meaningful time.

2003
01:12:23,392 --> 01:12:25,862
- An unforgettable moment. - I'll never forget it.

2004
01:12:26,502 --> 01:12:28,231
- Good luck. - Good luck with commentating.

2005
01:12:28,232 --> 01:12:29,472
- Keep up the good work. - Keep up the good work.

2006
01:12:29,872 --> 01:12:31,202
- Keep up the good work. - Keep up the good work.

2007
